        "en": "Na górze, na dole"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A bookcase has *góra* (the top) and *dół* (the bottom): *na górze* stands a plant, *na dole* lie the books. The chapter in a few words: a hotel room *jednoosobowy* or *dwuosobowy*; a flat *jednopokojowe* or *dwupokojowe*, *samodzielne* or shared, *stylowe* in an old house; a *dom jednorodzinny*; and *od podwórka*, at the back, there is little sun."
      }
    }
